                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-av-dark mt-4 mb-3">Firearm insurance claim-prep checklist</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">Keep a copy somewhere you can still open if the safe is gone.</p>
                    <a id="claim-prep-pdf-link" href="#" class="inline-block gradient-gold text-av-dark px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold hover:opacity-90 transition"><i class="bi bi-download mr-2"></i>Download PDF</a>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-8">Keep serials and photos in one place you can still open. <a href="https://app.arsenalvault.com/register?utm_source=checklist&utm_medium=thanks&utm_campaign=claim_prep_checklist&utm_content=thanks_register" class="text-av-gold font-semibold hover:underline">Start free, up to 5 firearms</a></p>
